{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_01_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_01","title":"花格窗边的梦想","storyCode":"SS-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c6928b3de8a5b4335c62e5ee4b4bbc4a2fdb7534eb08e454dd584f0c3d6f99e6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>维多利亚偏僻小镇</><p=2>9:37 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比之前预计的时间晚了整整四个小时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有多少时间了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街上完全没有人，这种地方也不可能有地图......这下麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如我们分头去找，有情况就用通讯器联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是个不错的主意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，其他人我都没有意见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但祥子你没有单独行动的经验，我不会让你一个人去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是考虑这种事情的时候吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她信里不是已经写了，“这是我的最后一封信。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一出现什么意外，那个少女......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......红豆，没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鞭刃小姐不是说过吗，以我现在的能力，我已经可以加入行动小组了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿出通讯器）要是遇到麻烦，我一定第一时间联系你，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还有我们呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。那你一定要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。爱丽丝小姐，那个孩子的名字和地址是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫“安”......地址是“花园街33号”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那我们就从这个十字路口开始，分头去找吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——怎么这里的路都这么复杂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边好像有个人......在卖花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这个时间了还有人在卖花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，找人要紧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，请问您知道花园街在哪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卖花的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是花园街。小姑娘，你要买花吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不买花......请问您知道花园街33号怎么走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卖花的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你抬头看看天上，朝着夕阳，往西边一直走到巷尾，最后那家就是33号了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老奶奶，现在已经是晚上了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卖花的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我真是老糊涂了......我说怎么这路上一点脚步声都没有，我也该收摊回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看不见吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卖花的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用管我，你不是还在找地方吗？快去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卖花的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜黑灯暗，可不要再迷路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......您也注意安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>花园街33号</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往西边一直走......这里就是那个老奶奶说的地方了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子缓缓推开破旧的木门，门框发出尖锐的吱呀声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......好大的酒味？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"地板上满是带着泥水的鞋印，而房间的尽头是一个穿着邋遢的男人。\n男人环顾四周，接着一个个地拿起角落里摆放整齐的酒瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是空的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜！安娜！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底到哪里去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，你是不是也和那个女人一样，丢下我跑了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......安娜......安娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再也不喝酒了！我会从现在开始努力！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人痛苦地跪倒，随之而来的是一声惨叫。\n方才打碎的酒瓶的碎片，毫不留情地刺入了他的掌心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！安娜，这地板上......血......我流血了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要死了！安娜，快回来！我要死了！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安娜......你回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是安娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是安娜......你是安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不认识我了吗？是我啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人朝祥子爬了过来，可很快又是一声惨叫。\n不知为何，祥子感到一阵强烈的伤感。\n她用手扶住了残缺的门沿——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣衫褴褛的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣衫褴褛的少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实那篇没有发表的故事，才是你身上真实发生过的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很喜欢童话。妈妈没离开前，给我买了很多很多的童话书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时我们一家真的很幸福，我、妈妈......还有爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可妈妈离开后，那些幸福就再也没有在我身上发生过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尝试把自己经历的一切写下来，展现给他人看，可没有人想要看到压抑和绝望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才把每一句的句意都颠倒，让它们变成最美好的童话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是我早就不看童话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（身体颤抖）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请、请不要叫那个名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，我不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比其他人，你已经对我很温柔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有爱丽丝，她很担心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识爱丽丝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我是跟着她一起来找你的。我刚和她联系了，她正在赶来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想见她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她很忙，每天有很多很多事要处理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是她非常重要的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......我今天曾无数次站在高处，然后向下望去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我口袋里装满了她写给我的信，我的手一直攥着它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她鼓励我努力活下去，还和我说，我故事里的美梦总会到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道该相信自己，还是该相信她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你完全可以相信她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟她是真正的仙女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仙女？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等她来了你就知道了，她说要在你成年以前——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子下意识地抬头看向了时钟。\n硕大的古钟悬挂于高墙之上，而时针与分针正在缓缓靠近，即将重合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝说要在成年以前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指生日前？爱丽丝要给我过生日？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，时间要来不及了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，我很久都没有过过生日了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我已经不是小孩子了。人长大了，就不需要庆祝了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在祥子环顾四周之时，她的视线落在了一个物件上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安，可以由我为你献上生日的祝福吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一架钢琴。\n月光洒在它的上面，仿佛它就是为了今夜而准备的。\n就算爱丽丝的美梦不能如期而至，祥子也想用自己的方式去为安做些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在变成“大人”之前的最后一刻，就让我用这首安眠曲作为礼物送给你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子缓缓走上台阶，而安坐在台下。\n心跳的节拍和倒数的指针一同，在两人之间逐渐变得清晰可闻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"扑通，扑通。\n嘀嗒，嘀嗒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子的双手在黑白琴键间游走着。\n音符随流逝的时间跳跃，为女孩奇迹般的诞生献上最为真挚的祝福。\n感谢你来到这片大地。\n希望你的未来一切顺利。\n愿你的童心，永不泯灭。\n随着最后一个音符落定，教堂的钟声恰好敲响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日快乐，安......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子转身看向女孩，却发现她已经伏在桌上睡着，表情带着一丝香甜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日快乐，安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝娜还在教堂里等安醒过来，我们就在外面散散步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好最后赶上了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，有惊无险，实在是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最后给她创造了一个什么样的梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个洁白的房间，干净得让人觉得不可能是现实的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在房间里，我先询问她愿不愿意进入我为她而造的梦境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝确实像位贵族小姐呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要信贝娜的那套说辞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“进入梦境前，必须征得孩子的同意。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是梦城堡规定的必要程序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你在最后，还有和她说什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在梦里告诉安，她的文字真的很美，我希望她能一直坚持写下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论何种风格、何种故事，甚至是不是童话都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这也是我想和她说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将她笔下的角色一一展现在了她眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱吃水果的蛀牙叔叔、倒立行走的玩偶小姐......他们一起举办了一场茶会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊，要是安能一直在这个梦中就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦不是用来沉溺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再美好的梦，终究是要醒来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使现实生活一团乱麻，也要醒来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明你和贝娜都有这么强的源石技艺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，你有些误解童话和梦城堡的力量了。和现实比起来，我们的能力实在有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们能做的，不过是在孩子们内心的最深处，留下一颗种子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它可能是年少时，心里觉得最重要的一件事，抑或是一个物品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不会时刻强调自己的存在，但它会在关键的时刻、一个人最脆弱的时刻，给予他力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是不是有点太严肃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。你说这些话的时候，眼神看上去很坚定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信往后的日子里，每当安回想起你为她所造的美梦，都会拾起活下去的信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也相信，但是我和你的理由可能略有不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在为她造梦前，我发现她心里已经有了一颗小小的种子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信念的种子，并不是只有通过梦城堡的美梦才能种下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了你，祥子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，祥子你钢琴弹得真的好好听啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前就说你肯定是玩音乐的好手，之后罗德岛上的演出你必须参加哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，红豆，你就不要为难我啦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在红豆和祥子打闹之时，爱丽丝从小匣子中拿出了一样东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，你之前不是说会做奇怪的梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个项链你随身带着，以后会少做一些噩梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......我真的能收下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心收下就好了，不是什么贵重的东西，只是在上面施了点小法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——我也想要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也做噩梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能......也许有吧？我不记得了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我能看出来，你从小到大睡眠质量一向很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——和你们这些仙女打交道真的好麻烦啊，一点秘密都没有！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"听着身旁同事们聊天，祥子小心地戴上了项链。\n一股温柔的凉意迅速从脖颈传递到全身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真美......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝，红豆，你们看——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红豆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子环顾四周。\n空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子开始往刚才的教堂走去，她的脚步不自觉地越来越快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"贝娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......？为什么会回到罗德岛......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你、你还、好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（转身）——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g1_rainystreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，一切都和以前一样......感觉就像做梦似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......做梦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，祥子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太阳晒屁股啦，该起床咯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"头好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥、子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥——子——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......这里是哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"此时此刻，她身处于一座巨大的城堡之中。\n顺着巨大的落地窗向天穹望去，双月悬于夜空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"寒冷的室温让她的神志清醒了一些，她开始环视四周。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疑惑的哼唧声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是什么怪物？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，有人醒过来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阴影之中，鞋跟与地面碰撞，发出一阵清脆的声音。\n而阴影之中的人，正在朝祥子慢慢靠近。\n咔哒，咔哒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，真没意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
